      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Xylem transports water unidirectionally, whereas Phloem transports food bidirectionally.",
        "Ethylene is the only gaseous plant hormone responsible for natural fruit ripening.",
        "Light reactions of photosynthesis take place in the Grana, while dark reactions (Calvin Cycle) take place in the Stroma."
